[72.601982, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe wheel builds correctly. Next I’ll construct the simple-index HTML with the correct SHA-256 fragment and start a background HTTP server rooted at the \r\nrepository.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nmkdir -p /app/pypi/packages /app/pypi/simple/vectorops\r\ncp /app/vectorops/dist/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl /app/pypi/packages/\r\nSHA256=$(sha256sum /app/pypi/packages/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl | awk '{print $1}')\r\ncat > /app/pypi/simple/index.html <<'EOF'\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html><head><title>Simple package index</title></head>\r\n<body>\r\n<a href=\"vectorops/\">vectorops</a>\r\n</body></html>\r\nEOF\r\ncat > /app/pypi/simple/vectorops/index.html <<EOF\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html><head><title>Links for vectorops</title></head>\r\n<body>\r\n<a href=\"../../packages/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl#sha256=${SHA256}\">vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl</a>\r\n</body></html>\r\nEOF\r\ncat /app/pypi/simple/vectorops/index.html\r\nnohup python3 -m http.server 8080 --directory /app/pypi > /app/pypi/http.log 2>&1 &\r\necho $! > /app/pypi/http.pid\r\nsleep"]
[72.60204, "o", " 1\r\ncat /app/pypi/http.pid\r\ncurl -fsS http://localhost:8080/simple/vectorops/\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
